message: "Cite this software version when referring to the code. Manuscript citation metadata will be added when available."
title: "BRAN patient representation and reproducibility tools"
abstract: >-
  BRAN learns a reusable 192-dimensional patient representation from blood
  measurements, other eligible clinical measurements, typed age and retinal
  features under incomplete observation. This repository holds the retained
  R7 model code, the hash-locked research source snapshot used for the
  reported analyses, the input contract, synthetic examples and tests, and
  the Source Data and code that redraw the paper figures. It holds no
  patient data and no trained weights.
type: software
